LangString SnowShotPathDescription 2052 "默认情况下，${SNOW_SHOT_INSTALLER_PRODUCT_NAME} 不会将其目录添加到系统 PATH。"
LangString SnowShotPathNone 2052 "不将 ${SNOW_SHOT_INSTALLER_PRODUCT_NAME} 添加到系统 PATH"
LangString SnowShotPathAll 2052 "为所有用户将 ${SNOW_SHOT_INSTALLER_PRODUCT_NAME} 添加到系统 PATH"
LangString SnowShotPathCurrent 2052 "为当前用户将 ${SNOW_SHOT_INSTALLER_PRODUCT_NAME} 添加到系统 PATH"
